  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed development, by reason of the excessive number of occupiers that it\r\naccommodates and poor outlook from bedroom 8, represents an overly\r\nintensive use of the site which would result in substandard living\r\naccommodation for existing and future occupiers of the site, and would be\r\nlikely to give rise to undue levels of disturbance and noise resulting in a\r\ndetrimental impact on the amenities of future occupiers and adjoining\r\nproperties. Furthermore, the proposal is unacceptable in principle due to the\r\nsite’s poor accessibility to public transport and essential services. The\r\nproposal is therefore contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), policies D3.D(7), D3.D(9), and D3.D(10) and D14 of The London Plan\r\n(2021) and policies GR1 and HO10 of the Harrow local Plan 2021-2041.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:8.0pt;line-height:115%&quot;&gt;The proposal would be out of character\r\nwith the existing, surrounding family homes within the immediate vicinity of\r\nthe application site. The proposal would therefore result in a detrimental\r\nimpact to the character of the area. The proposal is therefore contrary to the\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), policies D3.D(7), D3.D(9), and\r\nD3.D(10) and D14 of The London Plan (2021), policies GR1, HO10 of the Harrow\r\nlocal Plan 2021-2041.&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
